        <p>
            Creating a PDF from your images is simple and straightforward. Follow these steps:
        </p>
        <ol class="mb-4">
            <li>
                <strong>Upload your images</strong> – Drag and drop your image files into the upload area, or click the upload box to select images from your device. 
                Our converter supports JPG, PNG, GIF, and JPEG formats.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Arrange your images</strong> – The images are automatically arranged in the order they are uploaded. 
                You can also manually reorder them to ensure your PDF appears exactly as you want.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Click “Convert to PDF”</strong> – Start the conversion process with a single click. 
                The tool efficiently merges all images into one high-quality PDF document.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Download your PDF</strong> – Once conversion is complete, your PDF is ready for instant download. 
                You can store it securely or share it via email, messaging apps, or cloud storage.
            </li>
        </ol>

        <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Why Choose Our Image to PDF Converter?</h3>
