            <li>✔ <strong>Secure and private</strong> – Your files are processed securely and deleted from our servers after conversion.</li>
            <li>✔ <strong>Cross-platform support</strong> – Works seamlessly on Windows, Mac, Android, and iOS devices.</li>
            <li>✔ <strong>No installation or registration required</strong> – Convert images to PDF instantly from your browser.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="fw-semibold mt-4">Common Use Cases for Image to PDF Conversion</h3>
        <p>
